{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n ゲームは1時間までって\n よくお母さんの台詞でありますよね。\n \n そのありがたみが最近わかりました。\n \n 決めないと永遠にやっちゃう。\n 昨日も今日も明日もゲームと夜更かし〜🎵\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n \n 「アンビバレント」が発売されました〜👏\n  \n けやき坂46の「ハッピーオーラ」は\n タイプBに入っています！\n たくさん聞いてライブなどで一緒に\n 歌ってくださると嬉しいです！\n \n そして、自撮りTVは、、、\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XF81W6K7TWFRYY8D9YJPF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 菅井友香さんと高尾山に行ってきました〜⛰\n \n この日以来ゆかりと呼んでますふふふ\n 偶然白のキャップがお揃いですうふふ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XF97Y1WV2F0Y25K8KGCSS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 記憶上ほぼ初登山だったけど！\n ゆかりキャプテンと一緒だったので\n とても楽しかったです💗\n \n \n タイプCに入っているので\n 是非見てください(^-^)\n \n \n \n \n そういえばこの間の\n 握手会でめいちゃんの浴衣きました🌻\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFAA33BJ3W1Y7PB7H9NCN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFB9CTZAXGN5HT40BVRJE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFCBN7PK60RT0MGAEH277","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFDDKR80MK3G7SG5GPJHS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 浴衣はサイズが一緒です👼\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFEEQN30YMHN7SPRYGKVT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n めいちゃんありがとう。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFFHE5Z4NCN3J03RVB1JR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFGHM56FJ2RFKZNZ6PXHT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFHHJ0KDSPADK1Z8G3KK2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFJM9E5YFMA0DTSAGXWYB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFKNV1SCA73ZT232MRG6Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFMPY0Z7HNP4DENBSTAH0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 遅くなってしまったけど、\n お花ありがとうござました！\n \n \n そして大きな幕も！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XFNQT0EWGYTV3RS9XGVY4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 嬉しいですありがとうございます😳\n \n \n お知らせしたいことがまだたくさん！\n またすぐかきます〜〜💌\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}